# text = I allays offer it along with the sherry , though sister Glegg will have it I'm so extravagant ; and as for liking to have my clothes tidy , and not go a fright about the house , there's nobody in the parish can say anything against me in respect o ' backbiting and making mischief , for I don't wish anybody any harm ; and nobody loses by sending me a porkpie , for my pies are fit to show with the best o ' my neighbors' ; and the linen's so in order as if I was to die to-morrow I shouldn't be ashamed .
