# text = Go to his bedroom , but be very quiet at present Mr . Askern says you'll soon be all right again , Tulliver , did you know I've just been to ask Mr . Stelling , and he says you'll walk as well as ever again by-and-day Don't be a little silly , Magsie I shall soon get well Good-by , Tulliver I say ask Mr . Stelling to let you come and sit with me sometimes , till I get up again , Wakem ; and tell me about Robert Bruce , you know I didn't roar out a bit , you know and I dare say my foot was as bad as his .
