# text = It there's anything left as I could do to make you amends , I wouldn't say you nay Then we might stay here and get a living , and I might keep among my own sisters ,-- and me been such a good wife to you , and never crossed you from week's end to week's end -- and they all say so -- they say it ' ud be nothing but right , only you're so turned against Wakem Mother this is not the time to talk about that Let her be Say what you mean , Bessy Why , now the mill and the land's all Wakem's , and he's got everything in his hands , what's the use o ' setting your face against him , when he says you may stay here , and speaks as fair as can be , and says you may manage the business , and have thirty shillings a-week , and a horse to ride about to market ?
