# text = I would give up a great deal for _my_ father ; but I would not give up a friendship or -- or an attachment of any sort , in obedience to any wish of his that I didn't recognize as right I don't know Often , when I have been angry and discontented , it has seemed to me that I was not bound to give up anything ; and I have gone on thinking till it has seemed to me that I could think away all my duty .
