# text = Society couldn't be carried on if we inquired into private conduct in that way ,-- and Christianity tells us to think no evil ,-- and my belief is , that Miss Unit had no cards sent her I was coming to see you , Miss Tulliver ; you have anticipated me ; I am glad you did I want to tell you everything Do tell me everything Think of me as one to whom a long experience has been granted , which may enable him to help you _Oh , I must go_ Your prompting to go to your nearest friends ,-- to remain where all the ties of your life have been formed ,-- is a true prompting , to which the Church in its original constitution and discipline responds , opening its arms to the penitent , watching over its children to the last ; never abandoning them until they are hopelessly reprobate .
